@host = http://localhost:5166

### Receive the sample MSCONS (expects 200, state "Validated")
# @name receive
POST {{host}}/api/messages
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../../docs/samples/mscons_example.edi

### Look up the message just received
GET {{host}}/api/messages/{{receive.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Rejected message: sender is not a 13-digit market-partner ID (expects 422 with error list)
POST {{host}}/api/messages
Content-Type: text/plain

UNA:+.? '
UNB+UNOC:3+9900000000003:500+9900000000010:500+260116:0630+TST0000002'
UNH+1+MSCONS:D:04B:UN:2.4c'
BGM+7+MSI0000002+9'
DTM+137:202601160630?+01:303'
NAD+MS+12345::293'
NAD+MR+9900000000010::293'
UNS+D'
NAD+DP'
LOC+172+DE0001234567800000000000000000001'
LIN+1'
QTY+220:-0.250:KWH'
DTM+163:202601150000?+01:303'
DTM+164:202601150015?+01:303'
UNT+13+1'
UNZ+1+TST0000002'

### Unknown ID (expects 404)
GET {{host}}/api/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
